<title>UK: Reuters, BT in Intranet database deal.</title>
<headline>Reuters, BT in Intranet database deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters Holdings Plc, the international news and information company, said on Thursday it would supply business information to British Telecommunication Plc's Intranet service.</p>
<p>Reuters said its Reuters Business Briefing database would become the key information service on BT Intranet Complete, providing up-to-the minute news and company data.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
